### Path variable
GET http://localhost:8080/hello/Yennie

### Query parameters
GET http://localhost:8080/hello?user-name=Yennie&user-lastname=Peng

### Plain text request body
POST http://localhost:8080/post
Content-Type: text/plain

Hello Spring Boot!

### JSON mapped to a JavaBean
POST http://localhost:8080/post-order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Lucy",
  "productName": "iPhone",
  "quantity": 1
}

### JSON mapped to a record
POST http://localhost:8080/post-order-record
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Lucy",
  "productName": "iPhone",
  "quantity": 1
}
